flowchart TB
  A[Human or orchestrator] --> B[Shared run command bus\nCLI, MCP, web]
  B --> C[Resident run application\ngoal, plan, status, answer, steer, stop, evidence, review, adopt, integrate]
  C --> D[Task topology, waves, and workflow interpreter]
  D --> E[Route capability and liveness]
  E --> F1[Persistent Codex session]
  E --> F2[Persistent Claude session]
  E --> F3[Persistent GLM, Grok, Kimi, or other session]

  C <--> G[(Coordination store and append-only events)]
  D <--> G
  F1 <--> G
  F2 <--> G
  F3 <--> G

  G --> H[Questions, approvals, waits, checkpoints, messages, shared context]
  H --> C

  F1 --> I1[Owned Git worktree]
  F2 --> I2[Owned Git worktree]
  F3 --> I3[Owned Git worktree]
  I1 --> J[Candidate results]
  I2 --> J
  I3 --> J
  J --> K[Verification and review]
  K --> L[Preserve, adopt, integrate, export, cleanup]
  L --> G
